---
title: Server SDK · correlated preview telemetry under one provider
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant tab as Preview tab
  participant cp as Control plane
  participant prov as uTrace OTel provider
  participant app as Product server code
  participant exp as Redacting exporter
  participant ing as OTLP ingestion

  Note over cp,prov: Preview startup only, before application code.
  prov->>cp: activate · bootstrap credential
  cp-->>prov: signed identity + policy
  Note over prov: Verified config.<br/>Sole provider and sampler.<br/>Client auto-bootstrap disabled.
  prov->>app: instrument
  loop Each product request
    tab->>app: request · W3C trace context
    Note over app: Parent adopted only on the<br/>authenticated preview path.
    app->>exp: API · DB · HTTP · safe domain spans
    Note over exp: Normalize + redact.<br/>Typed safe span schema.
  end
  loop Bounded batching + retry
    exp->>ing: OTLP/HTTP batch
    ing-->>exp: ack · durable receipt
  end
  Note over ing: Authenticate + scope.<br/>Correlation readiness proof.
